cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "BOSSA: Binary Object environment-Sensitive Sampling Algorithm"
version: 1.0.0
abstract: >-
  BOSSA generates samples of ZAMS binaries (or higher-order multiples)
  consistent with the metallicity- and star-formation-rate-dependent IMF,
  the cosmic star-formation history, and the correlated orbital parameter
  distributions. Although its output is written with COMPAS in mind, it
  does not depend on it.
